 | `fj` | event | port, sub, character, then per part that changed: part, mask, values | a fighter's joints as the game left them at the frame's end (its animation, the blend into it, and whatever its own code set after: `ftParts`, the state's code, the swinging chains), the same nine values as `jp`, by part: every part with a live joint of its own, not part 0's place (only its turn and size, values 0 to 5: facing, the state's tilts and spins, model scale), not the presentation-only parts the hosted build leaves cold (`ftParts_HeadlessGameplayMask`), not a quaternion joint; a fighter's first line (and its first as another character) has all of them, then each value only on change |
+| `wf` | event | port, sub, character, then per part that changed: part, mask, values | only with `MSL_VIEWER_TRACK_WORLD=1` set as the track is made: a fighter part's world matrix as `HSD_JObjMakeMatrix` makes it from the joint's values at the frame's end (rows 0 to 2 of the 3 x 4 matrix, row by row, twelve values, mask bits 0-11), made in the track's own storage; left out, with all under them: cold parts, joints with an RObj (constraints, limits), IK joints, `JOBJ_USER_DEF_MTX`, `JOBJ_MTX_INDEP_PARENT`, `JOBJ_MTX_INDEP_SRT`, path animations |
+| `wi` | event | item, then per joint that changed: joint, mask, values | the same for an item's joints, numbered as `jp` numbers them, the root 0 too |
+| `ws` | event | part, then per joint that changed: joint, mask, values | the same for a stage part's joints, parts and joints numbered as `sp` numbers them; a part whose animation the hosted build stops is left out |
 | `lm` | event | item id, link count, then per link that changed: link, out, mask, values | a chain's links (hookshots, Samus's grapple, Sheik's chain, Ness's yo-yo, the Ice Climbers' belay): each link's matrix as the item's code set it (rows 0-2 of the 3x4, mask bits 0-11); link 0 is the end with no `prev`; out is `x2C_b0` (a link is drawn only then); a link that comes out or goes back is written whole |
 | `sp` | event | stage part, then per joint that changed: joint, mask, values | a stage part's joints as its animations and code left them (the moving parts: Fountain of Dreams', Yoshi's Story's and Pokemon Stadium's platforms and the rest), the same nine values as `jp`; the part is numbered as `gjoint` numbers it (its `map_id`, an extra copy's `map_id + 1000 * k`), the joint by preorder index in its tree as `stage_joint` counts it (0 the part's scale root from `Ground_801C14D0`, at rest rot 0, scale the stage's, translate 0; the file's tree from 1, an instance's children left out); a joint is written once it leaves the file's rest pose, then on change |
 | `ij` | state | item id, joint, offset x, y, z, 3x3 matrix | an item joint a generator was made on: place from the item's and its turn, at the frame's end |
